WEBVTT

00:13:30.001 --> 00:13:32.533
no matter how often
or how hard I blew into it.

00:13:32.557 --> 00:13:34.264
It just wouldn't work.

00:13:34.288 --> 00:13:35.612
(Laughter)

00:13:37.898 --> 00:13:39.279
But it's not only about that.

00:13:39.303 --> 00:13:40.461
It's about passion.

00:13:41.151 --> 00:13:44.058
Often, people are good at things
they don't really care for.

00:13:44.082 --> 00:13:45.276
It's about passion,

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:47.976
and what excites
our spirit and our energy.

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:51.381
And if you're doing the thing
that you love to do, that you're good at,

00:13:51.405 --> 00:13:53.675
time takes a different course entirely.

00:13:54.120 --> 00:13:56.297
My wife's just finished writing a novel,

00:13:56.321 --> 00:13:59.352
and I think it's a great book,

00:13:59.376 --> 00:14:01.976
but she disappears for hours on end.